              "explanation": "To find portfolios with holdings in more than 5 different sectors, I join portfolios, holdings, and securities (to get sector_id). I group by portfolio_name, count the distinct sectors, count the total holdings, and calculate the diversification ratio (sector_count / total_holdings). I filter for sector_count > 5."
